Subject: [PATCH 179/207] Port the rational proof patch into the split proof
 modules

tools/runner-graph-rational-proof.patch applied with no fuzz to the exact and
point modules joined in the monolith's order (one constant offset), then split
back. Its new named test goes to runner_proof_rational_test.zig, keeping every
module under 600 lines.
